   "fieldname": "typst_help",
   "fieldtype": "HTML",
   "label": "Typst Help",
   "options": "<div>\n  <h4 style=\"margin:0 0 8px;\">Typst Help</h4>\n  <div style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\">\n    <strong>Notes</strong>\n    <ol style=\"margin:6px 0 0 18px;\">\n      <li><code>typst_preamble</code> runs before any document content.</li>\n      <li><code>doc_header</code> defines <code>header_block</code> used in <code>#set page(header: header_block)</code>.</li>\n      <li><code>doc_footer</code> defines <code>footer_block</code> used in <code>#set page(footer: footer_block)</code>.</li>\n    </ol>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\">\n    <strong>Examples</strong>\n    <ol style=\"margin:6px 0 0 18px;\">\n      <li>Preamble: <code>#set text(font: \"Inter 18pt\", size: 11pt)</code></li>\n      <li>Header: <code>#let header_block = [#text(weight: 700)[#doc.doctype]]</code></li>\n      <li>Footer: <code>#let footer_block = [#text(size: 8pt)[#doc.name]]</code></li>\n    </ol>\n  </div>\n  <div>\n    <strong>Branding</strong>\n    <div style=\"margin-top:4px;\">Letterhead is rendered in <code>background</code>. Logo and QR are rendered in <code>foreground</code>.</div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
  }
